    </constants>
    <description>When an account becomes an Active Customer, hands off across functions: welcome task (CS), proactive health-check case (Support queue), invoice-prep task (Finance, interim owner Clement Okeniyi until a finance user is hired), and a Chatter audit post. Recursion guard: fires only on the transition into Active Customer; its own actions never update the Account.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Case_Subject</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Proactive health check - &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Chatter_Body</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Active Customer confirmed. Cross-functional handoff complete: CS welcome task, proactive support case, and finance invoice prep created.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Invoice_Due</name>
